Z||000009||REDHOTT88||11-27-2001||09:32 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by REDHOTT88:<BR><B><BR>Thank you all for the info... It looked like it might be easy, but I didn't want to do something really stupid!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif">   Now I feel better!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NICE engine Avengador1 ! Can I eat off that?<BR><p>[This message has been edited by REDHOTT88 (edited 11-27-2001).]||||reg||1
